OL,3,GNEWSADistorted rail causes train
OL,4,Acancellations
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers are facing delays and
OL,7,Fcancellations to their services due to
OL,8,Fa section of distorted rail.
OL,10,FLondon Northwestern Railway (LNR) said
OL,11,Ftrack repairs were taking place between
OL,12,FLong Buckby and Northampton.
OL,14,FNational Rail said delays were expected
OL,15,Fbetween Rugby and Milton Keynes Central
OL,16,Funtil 19:00 BST, while LNR said
OL,17,Fservices could be altered or cancelled
OL,18,Fbetween London Euston and Birmingham
OL,19,FNew Street.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
