OL,3,GNEWSADistorted rail causes train
OL,4,Acancellations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn LNR spokesperson said: "We apologise
OL,7,Fto customers for the inconvenience
OL,8,Fcaused. Any passengers delayed by 15
OL,9,Fminutes or more as a result of the
OL,10,Fdisruption are entitled to compensation
OL,11,Fagainst the cost of their ticket under
OL,12,Fthe Delay Repay scheme."
